#!name=QX Rewrite Probe
#!desc=QX 重写能力探测：验证 script-request-header 是否支持 url/path、script-response-body 改响应体、请求响应脚本共享数据。所有探测目标都指向局域网地址 192.168.50.3:18765。配合 qx-rewrite-probe-server.mjs 使用。
#!homepage=https://github.com/DemoJameson/Proxy.Modules
#!author=DemoJameson
#!updatedTime=2026-10-24 19:40:00

# [P1] script-response-body 是否支持改响应体（192.168.50.3:18765/status）
^https?:\/\/192\.168\.50\.3:18765\/status(?:\?.*)?$ url script-response-body https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DemoJameson/Proxy.Modules/refs/heads/codex/qx-rewrite-probe/qx-rewrite-probe/qx-rewrite-probe.js

# [P2] script-request-header 返回 { url }（跨域改写是否被支持/半套用；目标 httpbin.org 仅在启用的瞬间被访问）
^https?:\/\/192\.168\.50\.3:18765\/url(?:\?.*)?$ url script-request-header https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DemoJameson/Proxy.Modules/refs/heads/codex/qx-rewrite-probe/qx-rewrite-probe/qx-rewrite-probe.js

# [P3] script-request-header 返回 { path }（官方支持的形态是否生效）
^https?:\/\/192\.168\.50\.3:18765\/path(?:\?.*)?$ url script-request-header https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DemoJameson/Proxy.Modules/refs/heads/codex/qx-rewrite-probe/qx-rewrite-probe/qx-rewrite-probe.js

# [P4] 请求阶段记录 $request 真实内容
^https?:\/\/192\.168\.50\.3:18765\/echo(?:\?.*)?$ url script-request-header https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DemoJameson/Proxy.Modules/refs/heads/codex/qx-rewrite-probe/qx-rewrite-probe/qx-rewrite-probe.js

# [P4] 响应阶段回读请求阶段记录并输出 JSON
^https?:\/\/192\.168\.50\.3:18765\/echo(?:\?.*)?$ url script-response-body https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DemoJameson/Proxy.Modules/refs/heads/codex/qx-rewrite-probe/qx-rewrite-probe/qx-rewrite-probe.js
